WEBVTT

00:17:58.708 --> 00:18:01.226
OK, this is going to be
a different kind of ad.

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:04.559
I've played a personal role
in selecting the sponsors for this podcast

00:18:04.583 --> 00:18:07.226
because they all have
interesting cultures of their own.

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:10.125
Today, we're going inside
the workplace at BetterUp.

00:18:14.458 --> 00:18:16.976
Alexi Robichaux:
I remember vividly driving down

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:19.768
in my little Prius down to Palo Alto

00:18:19.792 --> 00:18:23.893
and on numerous occasions being like,
"This is so scary, so intimidating."

00:18:23.917 --> 00:18:25.875
Do I need to just pull over to vomit?

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.643
AG: That's Alexi Robichaux.

00:18:28.667 --> 00:18:32.768
When he was 26, the startup he worked for
was acquired by a big company.